  "cited_article_id": "manage-practice-subscription-billing",
  "reply": "To update your credit card, go to **Billing > Subscription Settings** in the account portal, open the **Payment Methods** tab, and click **Add New Card** or **Edit** next to the existing card. Enter the new card and billing address, then click **Save Changes**. Only users with the Practice Manager role can access these settings."
